---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { productSchema } from '../data/seoSite';
const title = 'Pantaloni cu snur lung si pantaloni scurti';
const description = 'Pantaloni cu snur lung si variante scurte negre pentru vara, moda urbana relaxat si croieli unisex. Vezi modelele!';
const canonical = 'https://pantalonicusnurlung.ro/pantaloni-cu-snur-scurti/';
const image = '/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg';
const schema = [
  { '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'WebPage', name:title, url:canonical, image:new URL(image, canonical).href },
  productSchema('Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung', 'https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-scurti-barbati-atelier-axd', 'https://pantalonicusnurlung.ro/pantaloni-scurti-negri-cu-snur-lung.jpg'),
];
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} image={image} type="website" schema={schema}>
<section id="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="container"><div class="hero-inner-wrapper"><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-badge">Ghid urban 2026</div><h1 class="hero-h1">Pantaloni cu<br/><span class="line2">snur lung</span><br/>si scurti</h1><p class="hero-sub">Modelele scurte pastreaza acelasi limbaj moda urbana: negru, talie elastica, snur alb lung si purtare usoara vara.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">Verifica disponibilitatea pe AtelierAXD</a><a href="/ghid-marimi-pantaloni-cu-snur" class="btn-ghost">Ghid marimi</a></div></div></div><div class="hero-stats"><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Ghid</div><div class="stat-label">Informativ</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Unisex</div><div class="stat-label">Purtat si de femei</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">AtelierAXD</div><div class="stat-label">Disponibilitate</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Card</div><div class="stat-label">sau ramburs</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="colectie"><div class="container"><div class="services-header reveal"><div><span class="section-tag">// Catalog informativ</span><h2 class="section-h2">Alege modelul de <em>pantaloni</em> preferat</h2></div><p class="section-lead">Prezentam editorial croieli moda urbana cautate, disponibile prin AtelierAXD, cu accent pe pantaloni cu snur lung, negru, lejer si unisex.</p></div><div class="services-grid"><a class="service-card  reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg" alt="Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual" title="Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual" width="1200" height="1600" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual</div><div class="service-desc">Croiala lejera potrivita pentru un aspect relaxat. Echilibru intre moda urbana si casual, purtat usor de baieti si fete.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Popular</span><span class="tag">Unisex lejer</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-barbati-negri-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung" title="Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Varianta clasica reinventata, cu material durabil, asezare buna pe incaltaminte sport si snur lung vizibil.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Croiala clasica</span><span class="tag">Selectie</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-scurti-negri-cu-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung" title="Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Pentru sezonul cald: acelasi impact vizual moda urbana intr-o pereche scurta si confortabila.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Vara</span><span class="tag">Scurti</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-scurti-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung" title="Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Alternativa pentru zile de vara petrecute in oras, cu material placut si croiala lejera.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Croiala de vara</span><span class="tag">Urban</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-oversized-barbati-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung" title="Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Larg, masiv, pur moda urbana. Pentru look foarte larg inspirat din cultura urbana internationala.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Oversized</span><span class="tag">Larg</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-slim-snur-lung-atelieraxd.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD" title="Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD</div><div class="service-desc">Croiala slim selectata pentru asezare mai apropiata de corp, pastrand detaliul urban al snurului lung.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Croiala slim</span><span class="tag">AtelierAXD</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="split-grid"><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Pentru vara</h2><p>Pantalonii scurti cu snur lung sunt alternativa lejera cand vrei acelasi look, dar mai mult confort termic.</p></article><article class="content-panel reveal"><h2>Diferenta fata de lungi</h2><p>Pantaloni cu snur lung sunt mai versatili pe mai multe sezoane, in timp ce modelele scurte sunt clare pentru zile calde.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="content-panel reveal" style="text-align:center"><span class="section-tag">// vezi colectia</span><h2 class="section-h2" style="margin:0 auto 18px">Pantaloni cu snur lung AtelierAXD</h2><p style="max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 26px">Daca ai ales stilul, verifica detaliile pe AtelierAXD pentru modele disponibile, plata si livrare.</p><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/collections/pantaloni-barbati-atelier-axd" class="btn-primary">Vezi stocul actualizat pe AtelierAXD</a></div></div></section></Layout>
